# Regenerable, 2.6 MB, and tied to both CONTRACT_VERSION and the simulator
# fingerprint -- load_corpus refuses a mismatched one anyway (finding 16). A
# tracked copy is a stale binary waiting to be loaded, which is how `make eval`
# came to report numbers from a corpus a third of the intended size.
out/corpus_cache.npz
